Visual Pinball X for Debian Linux
==================================

This package provides Visual Pinball X, an open source pinball
table editor and simulator for Linux.

Installation
------------
After installation, you may need to install community table archives
to use the full functionality of the simulator. Tables are typically
available from community repositories.

Configuration
-------------
- User data files are stored in ~/.config/vpinball/
- Plugins are installed in /usr/lib/vpinball/plugins/
- Tables should be placed in ~/.config/vpinball/tables/

Dependencies
------------
This package requires the following additional packages for full
functionality:
- vpinball-tables: Community pinball tables
- vpinball-docs: Additional documentation

VR/XR Support
-------------
For VR support, additional packages may be required:
- openxr-demo: OpenXR runtime
- steam: SteamVR (if using SteamVR runtime)

Plugin System
-------------
This package includes several plugins:
- PinMAME: Emulation of real pinball machines
- B2S: Backglass display support
- DOF: Device of Feeling output support
- DMDUtil: Dot matrix display utilities
- FlexDMD: Flexible DMD support
- AltSound: Alternate sound engine

For more information, see:
- https://github.com/vpinball/vpinball
- https://vpinball.com/